      "cooked": "<p>I noticed any instance of a jinja variable is not rendering on the print preview or PDF. It just shows the literal variable declaration eg {{start_date}}.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/a/5ac63b1c2d77a7e24420005c73caf2a366a53c5a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5ac63b1c2d77a7e24420005c73caf2a366a53c5a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5ac63b1c2d77a7e24420005c73caf2a366a53c5a_2_690x258.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cX1GaeCwIP8HbUB5Z3njBRuwAjM\" width=\"690\" height=\"258\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5ac63b1c2d77a7e24420005c73caf2a366a53c5a_2_690x258.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/a/5ac63b1c2d77a7e24420005c73caf2a366a53c5a.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/a/5ac63b1c2d77a7e24420005c73caf2a366a53c5a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F4F6F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">697×261 15.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I am following the instructions as per the Contract Template Example:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/1/f17caec861b04594b3e31a05e8cfbe0f6c0a650b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f17caec861b04594b3e31a05e8cfbe0f6c0a650b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/1/f17caec861b04594b3e31a05e8cfbe0f6c0a650b.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ysicwcZsHw5djKkuRcu5Y1qhs8P\" width=\"690\" height=\"272\" data-dominant-color=\"5C5C5C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">802×317 24.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I have also tried with and without the spaces between the {{ }} just in case but it doesn’t work.</p>\n<p>If I set a custom HTML field in the Print Designer and use the same variable declaration it renders fine, but I want to be able to use them in the Contract Template.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your help!</p>",
